---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="A complete FV project, start to finish" description="From microarchitecture spec to coverage closure">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="article-header">
      <div class="article-meta">
        <span class="tag">FV methodology</span>
        <span class="tag">JasperGold</span>
      </div>
      <h1>A complete formal verification project, start to finish</h1>
      <p class="article-desc">
        From microarchitecture spec to coverage closure — how a real FV engagement
        is structured and executed.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="article-body">
      <p class="placeholder-notice">
        Full article coming soon. Outline below.
      </p>

      <h2>Outline</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Reading the microarchitecture specification — what to look for</li>
        <li>Writing the Verification Plan — scope, intent, and coverage goals</li>
        <li>Writing the Verification Architecture Specification</li>
        <li>Building the formal testbench in SystemVerilog</li>
        <li>Writing SVA properties — sequences, properties, and auxiliary code</li>
        <li>Setting up the JasperGold environment with TCL scripting</li>
        <li>Running proofs — interpreting results, vacuity, and unreachability</li>
        <li>Complexity reduction — when and how to use abstraction and blackboxing</li>
        <li>Bug triage and root-cause collaboration with the design team</li>
        <li>Coverage closure — what done actually looks like</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
.article-header {
  padding: 3rem 0 2rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}
.article-meta { display: flex; gap: 0.4rem; margin-bottom: 0.875rem; }
h1 { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1.75rem; }
.article-desc {
  color: var(--color-muted);
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  max-width: 560px;
  margin: 0;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
.article-body { padding-bottom: 4rem; max-width: 660px; }
.article-body h2 { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); padding-bottom: 0.4rem; }
.article-body ol { color: var(--color-text); }
.article-body li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }
.placeholder-notice {
  background: var(--color-bg-subtle);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: 0.875rem 1rem;
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  color: var(--color-muted);
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}
</style>
